# Northward (jeuno 24) with its era module: modules/era/lua/quests/jeuno/northward.lua, enabled by its condition
# xi.pre(xi.expansion.SOA) (RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_SOA 0), replaces the reward table: the Map of Castle Zvahl and
# Envoy to the North only (no exp, no gil: added in 2013). Accepted by a GM; the Flame Degen traded: 61, finished:
# completed with the module's reward, fame +13 x3, the degen taken.
# The condition's false side cannot be a module flow (the harness fails a flow whose module is not enabled); the
# quest's own flows are that side.
module modules/era/lua/quests/jeuno/northward.lua
lists RuludeGardens/Radeivepart/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Radeivepart/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/61
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=5.9,9,-38.7 job=WAR lvl=75
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
quest Jeuno.Northward accepted
item FlameDegen
login
trade Radeivepart FlameDegen x1     # 61
finish                              # completed: the map and the title only; fame +13 x3; the degen taken
